<!--

Multiple cartridge types exist:
- Expansion carts with ROM
- "My Magic Cards" / "My Stuff Keys" / "My Real Magic Keys" with only SEEPROM (for unlocking in-game content, stored in settings?)
- "My Magic Keys" (for unlocking in-game content and additional mini-games, inserts into expansion cart slot)
- "My World Keys" (Playmates expansion carts without "My Magic Keys" slot?)

Known "My Magic Cards":
- 14(?) Accessori
- 14(?) Fashion

Known "My Magic Keys":
- 6 Special Summer Gold
- 12 Special Summer Fashion

Known "My Real Magic Keys":
- 20 Accessori
- 20 Fashion

-->

<!--

Cartridge slot pinout (74ac00 on expansion carts has 2 output pins used as additional ROM address lines):

 NC|01|VCC
CEi|02|WE (Internal ROM)
A00|03|NC
A01|04|D01
A02|05|NC
A03|06|NC
A04|07|NC
A05|08|SDA(24c02)
A06|09|NC
A07|10|D03
===|==|===
A08|11|NC
A09|12|NC
A10|13|NC
A11|14|NC
A12|15|NC
A13|16|Pin13 74ac00
A14|17|Pin09 74ac00
A15|18|Pin12 74ac00
A16|19|D15
A17|20|D14
A18|21|D13
A19|22|D12
A20|23|D11
A21|24|D10
 OE|25|D09
D08|26|SCL(24c02)
D00|27|D07
D06|28|NC
D02|29|D05
D04|30|GND

CEi = CE Internal ROM! (set to VCC in Cartridge-PCB)

-->

